Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N01  START WITH ONE ACTION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fluent Me is a conversation-first English coach built on Tavus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,This narrated tour uses real session captures to show one focused loop.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N02  CONTINUE TO START THE ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A Tavus room starts only after the learner selects Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:22.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Topic and time box stay optional, and the coach itself can be created from your own face and voice.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N03  CAPTURE THE TAVUS ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is a live Tavus conversation, captured while the coach was responding: Phoenix renders the Face, Sparrow keeps the turns natural, and detailed tools wait in a drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The end state is immersion: talking with yourself, in your own face and your own cloned voice, so imitation collapses into repetition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:45.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The sequence shows visible coach motion in that interval, not learner-audio transport.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.00,0:00:48.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N04  READ THE TAVUS TRANSCRIPT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:50.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,After a captured turn, Feedback shows only evidence that exists:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:58.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Tavus transcript, timing, counted pauses or repeats, and available microphone or Raven signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:01.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,None of it becomes an opaque English score.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N05  GROUND ONE USEFUL CHANGE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:06.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The grounded review turns available evidence into one useful change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:11.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grammar and wording stay separate from pace and rhythm observations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A phrase worth keeping moves to spaced review, and missing evidence stays hidden rather than guessed.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,\N06  DOCUMENT THE BOUNDARIES
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,History is opt-in and stays on this device.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:28.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,And a session survives its room: after a provider time cap, the coach reconnects and continues the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Captured motion alone does not prove audio transport or cleanup.
